The Z-matrix for the fep calculation needs to be called fepzmat. Then,
to execute an entire fep calculation in water with T=25C and #waters=500,
just enter
csh fepcmd >& log &

xFEPAQ provides a convenient way to run a single fep calculation
in any directory. Runs 10 FEP windows. 
For an analogous FEP calculation with 725 waters, use xFEPAQ725

For 14 windows, xFEPAQ14
For 25 windows, xFEPAQ25

For the Yale queuing system:
xFEPAQQ      - 10 windows
XFEPAQ14Q    - 14 windows
XFEPAQ25Q    - 25 windows
